# Sanity CMS - read-only token (optional for public/read-only queries)
# Create one at https://www.sanity.io/manage/personal/projects/<projectId>/api
# NOTE: This has NO "VITE_" prefix. It is read at build time via vite.config.ts
# `define` and inlined into the browser bundle, so it is NOT truly private.
SANITY_TOKEN=your_sanity_token_here

# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (optional)
# Find it in your GA4 property under Admin > Data Streams > Your web stream
REACT_APP_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
